// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P3846939653" "<color yellow>Your task owner needs to speak to {BOSS_NAME}"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page TaskOwner Text :
"P1472027022" "I've got all kinds of amenities that you just can't find anywhere else in the gumbo. What would you like?"
// Answer Text :
"P155392375" "You look like you could use some protection."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3881702309" "Protection? Oh {Hero.gender=male honey|sugarplum}, I got all the protection I need from my boys..."
// Answer Text :
"P2711072898" "Yeah, they aren't gonna cut it."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3357220388" "I'm flattered you want to work for me, {Hero.gender=male big boy|darlin'}, but I think I'd have better use for you as a client than another hired hand. All my {hero.gender=male girls|boys} are ready to entertain.<br><br>What's your pleasure?"
// Answer Text :
"P3181563159" "I don't want to work for you. I'm here to collect."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P677845560" "Collect!? You tryin' to cut in on my business!?"
// Answer Text :
"P1848433629" "(Bust the place up)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1509092045" "{BOSS_NAME} runs a <i>dance hall</i> out around the Sunken City. I know, she's crazy, but nobody ever messes with her entertainers. The way I figure it, she's in need of some <i>protection</i> in case something bad happens to her business. <color orange>I'd like you to pay her a little visit and show her how bad it would be not to pay for that protection</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P3704068273" "(PROTECTION RACKET) You want me to mess her up too?"
// SendOffString :
"P1456933296" "No need to hurt her, <color orange>just smash up her place and work over her entertainment a little</color>. That should get the message across."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P973777" "Start a racketeering ring on the Dregs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1574976120" "Remember, no need to bust up {BOSS_NAME}'s face. After all, we don't need to seem... <i>uncivilized</i>."
// TaskTitle :
"P194352599" "<font face=title><color orange>PROTECTION RACKET</color></font>"

