// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P73486533" "We've got a new VIP in the Ward, the <i>anonymous danger junkie</i> type, currently goin' by the moniker <color yellow>{VIP_NAME}</color>. Dunno if he's new from Cole-side or somehow risen up to gumbo bourgeois, an' I don't much care. Thing is, he's looking for a new kick-- he wants to get possessed by an Apparition and ride the anger-high."
// AcceptString :
"P3202990700" "(PEDDLING POSSESSION) You gotta be kiddin' me."
// SendOffString :
"P4198830365" "It's more common than you think. And we ain't here to judge {VIP_NAME}, we're here to give him what he wants. There's a <color yellow>Possession Den</color> over in the Free-Fire Zone. {VIP_NAME} will meet you there. He wants an armed escort an' that's you. Just escort him to one of the Apparitions and let it do what it does.<br><br>Before you start sweatin', the other ghost-junkies in the den won't be hostile. Why fight for a host when you've got 'em coming to your doorstep, am I right?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P879306296" "Satisfy the client's need for possession"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P702703148" "What, you don't like money? Then get back and make sure {VIP_NAME} gets his possession fix."
// TaskTitle :
"P281900792" "<font face=title><color orange>PEDDLING POSSESSION</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3200965290" "Now that {VIP_NAME} is here, they've gotten a bit excited, a common enough trait in danger junkies."
// ExitStringFail :
"P2682533595" "You took too long to kick the Carnies out of there. The possessed have all wigged out now. It's gonna take awhile before that den is trusted again, and even longer before they trust Caldoun again."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2809618513" "Wait for Caldoun to get back into contact"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P634020053" "Defeat the Carnival enemies quickly"
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P1370190628" "The Apparitions are getting angry!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"

